Package: sc-update
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-yaml, git, openssh-client, systemd
Recommends: plymouth, docker.io | docker-ce, docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose-plugin
Maintainer: Smart Campus <admin@example.com>
Description: Smart Campus system updater
 Checks the latest tag on the main branch of the repository in
 /opt/smart-campus against /etc/sc-update/version and, automatically or after
 asking the user (Plymouth and shell), updates it and rebuilds and starts the
 docker compose project. Runs at boot as a systemd service.
